    "title": "Middle East Analyst Explains the Resilience of Iran's Nuclear and Missile Program",
    "text": "A variety of international sanctions are in place against Iran’s nuclear project and missile program. However, undercutting the effectiveness of these restrictions is the extensive and longstanding assistance Tehran is receiving from Chinese nationals. To break down the situation, NTD spoke to David Wurmser, a senior analyst at the Center for Security Policy and former senior advisor to former U.S. Vice President Cheney.\nMiddle East Analyst Explains the Resilience of Iran's Nuclear and Missile Program\nDavid Wurmser, senior analyst, discussed the extensive and longstanding assistance Iran receives from China.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 8/6/2025, 11:46:26 PM EDT",
